{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 12590912275820037644,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Note",
      "source_hash": 3426805193066476884,
      "context_hash": 10181631955045347318,
      "translation": "참고",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848685Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The `note` command can be used to update the top comment of a GitHub issue with a summary.",
      "source_hash": 12341807299106257576,
      "context_hash": 15251819684885994835,
      "translation": "`note` 명령은 요약을 통해 GitHub 이슈의 최상단 댓글을 업데이트하는 데 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848686Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Usage",
      "source_hash": 8769925957682373409,
      "context_hash": 9824972568437362436,
      "translation": "사용법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848686Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A summary note can be added to a GitHub issue by writing a comment with the command:",
      "source_hash": 8835158735958707099,
      "context_hash": 7796770109031009119,
      "translation": "요약 노트는 다음 명령으로 댓글을 작성하여 GitHub 이슈에 추가할 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The word after `note` is then added as a link to the top comment of the GitHub issue:",
      "source_hash": 3712874441320966468,
      "context_hash": 5629902921432432961,
      "translation": "`note` 뒤에 오는 단어는 GitHub 이슈의 최상단 댓글에 링크로 추가됩니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "with a link to the comment where you posted the `note` command.",
      "source_hash": 12637653126807184016,
      "context_hash": 11946426342498051958,
      "translation": "`note` 명령을 게시한 댓글로의 링크와 함께 표시됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The title word can be a sequence of characters matching the regular expression `[^.,:!?;\\n() ]+`.",
      "source_hash": 5446552592858624235,
      "context_hash": 6658455089825397741,
      "translation": "제목 단어는 정규 표현식 `[^.,:!?;\\n() ]+`에 매칭되는 문자열이 될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:1",
      "source": "Or it can be a quoted string like `\"this is a title\"`.",
      "source_hash": 3205708022184450085,
      "context_hash": 13983571114933179389,
      "translation": "또는 `\"this is a title\"`와 같은 따옴표로 묶인 문자열이 될 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848687Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Additional notes will get appended to the list:",
      "source_hash": 6155819182312799331,
      "context_hash": 10102913562569306396,
      "translation": "추가 노트는 목록에 덧붙여집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "This summary section should **not** be edited by hand.",
      "source_hash": 7347942819981291494,
      "context_hash": 17962433587075101688,
      "translation": "이 요약 섹션은 수동으로 편집해서는 **안 됩니다**.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Removing an existing summary",
      "source_hash": 7486515149628486090,
      "context_hash": 7588985656661517999,
      "translation": "기존 요약 제거하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Notes can be removed by writing a comment with `@rustbot note remove summary-title`, where `summary-title` is the word used when the note was created.",
      "source_hash": 12005118641719396619,
      "context_hash": 13330600047052124427,
      "translation": "노트는 `@rustbot note remove summary-title` 댓글을 작성하여 제거할 수 있으며, 여기서 `summary-title`은 노트를 생성할 때 사용한 단어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "Triagebot will remove the entry from the summary list.",
      "source_hash": 16135067761101977236,
      "context_hash": 14344421200366525493,
      "translation": "Triagebot는 요약 목록에서 항목을 제거합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:14.587480Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 14010406861830250115,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "[!NOTE] This feature is [enabled by default](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml) in the rust-lang organization.",
      "source_hash": 17648849861768685535,
      "context_hash": 16035206328662794018,
      "translation": "[!참고] 이 기능은 rust-lang 조직에서 [기본적으로 활성화되어](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml) 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:18:14.587481Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "This feature is enabled by having a `[note]` table in `triagebot.toml`:",
      "source_hash": 17575806721587293970,
      "context_hash": 5155831482035546712,
      "translation": "이 기능은 `triagebot.toml`에 `[note]` 테이블을 두어 활성화합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 8709674087747073439,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See [`parser/src/command/note.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/note.rs) and [`src/handlers/note.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/note.rs).",
      "source_hash": 2680144364900343642,
      "context_hash": 5801226501789644448,
      "translation": "[`parser/src/command/note.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/parser/src/command/note.rs)와 [`src/handlers/note.rs`](https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/HEAD/src/handlers/note.rs)를 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:45:45.848688Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}